    "text": "Foo Fighters’ New Drummer Revealed: Band Trades With Fellow ’90s Legends\nBy Matthew Wilkening,\n3 hours agoThe Foo Fighters have reportedly chosen a new drummer. And in related news, so have Nine Inch Nails. As it turns out, there's no need to feel bad for outgoing Foo Fighters drummer Josh Freese, because he's returning to his former gig alongside Trent Reznor in Nine Inch Nails. In effect, the two bands have traded drummers.",
